# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor / app backups
*.bak
*.bak.[0-9]*

# Claude Code.
#
# ~/.claude is overwhelmingly runtime state and secrets: .credentials.json holds
# OAuth tokens, history.jsonl is the full prompt history, and projects/ and
# sessions/ are session transcripts. None of that belongs in a public repo.
#
# So this is a whitelist, not a blacklist — everything under the package is
# ignored by default and only the hand-maintained config is re-included. Adding
# a new tracked file means adding a matching negation here on purpose.
claude/.claude/*
!claude/.claude/settings.json
!claude/.claude/statusline-command.sh
!claude/.claude/skills/
